Output docs/demo/dot.gif

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 900
Set Height 620
Set Padding 20
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 80ms

Hide
Type "source docs/demo/env.sh && clear"
Enter
Sleep 3s
Show

Sleep 1s
Type "dot --help"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 2s
Type "dot"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 4s
